    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s11-t02-drill-13-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s11-t02-drill-13",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "先选分组成员，再按组大小数负责人；“不能是组内最小”排除的是每组1个固定成员。"
        }
      ],
